WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.200
Open the Portfolio

2
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.700
Tap + for a new project

3
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:15.800
Ready-made plans for work people do again and again

4
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:19.700
Pick one — say, College Semester

5
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:23.300
Create

6
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:27.600
The project arrives with its tasks, headings and milestones

7
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:31.100
Your own project can become one too

8
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:34.600
Touch and hold a project

9
00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:38.200
Save as Playbook

10
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:44.200
Its structure is kept; dates and progress are cleared

11
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:47.800
Start a new project again

12
00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:52.100
Scroll past the ready-made plans

13
00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:56.500
There it is, under Your Playbooks

14
00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:06.200
…ready for the next project like it
